and side.  The word ‘Lux’ is written on the door in light-coloured paint. " height="2355" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6ae9a05c253e7.jpg" width="2355"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 08:50:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>下班途中爆胎等拖车</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae8fd3e590df</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在下班回家路上车胎瘪了，现在正在I-95公路上等拖车 😭&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A view of i95 south through the median. The trees are changing colors for autumn. " height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6ae8fd3e590df.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 21:15:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>咒语就用你自己的话</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae8f6968a3ac</link><description>&lt;p&gt;咒语可以听起来像你自己。当你写下要对护身符念出的词句时，不需要模仿老派语言。用你真正会用的词来表达你的意思，能让你在念出它们时更自信。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy scene of a silver-haired witch reading a handwritten spell over a wooden charm inside a vast charcoal bell, framed by rose-pink drapery. A pencil, revised draft, and sleeping black cat rest on the desk; floating bells overlook a green valley. Ivory serif lettering curves overhead, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: A spell can sound like you. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ae8f6968a3ac.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:46:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>用于释放不受欢迎关注的仪式盐
